WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.875
- Vision?
- Yes, my love?

00:00:01.875 --> 00:00:03.420
WANDA MAXIMOFF
Is this really happening?

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:06.102
VISION
I think a few unsavory characters

00:00:06.102 --> 00:00:07.835
are settling in the neighborhood.

00:00:07.859 --> 00:00:10.481
AGNES
Are you here to help us? [Laughing]

00:00:11.898 --> 00:00:13.316
VISION
I think something's wrong here.

00:00:13.696 --> 00:00:15.299
WANDA MAXIMOFF
There's no need to get dramatic.

00:00:15.323 --> 00:00:16.859
VISION
Did you really not see what I saw?

00:00:17.347 --> 00:00:19.284
WANDA MAXIMOFF
We have everything under control.

00:00:19.284 --> 00:00:21.217
(If you're not watching WandaVision,)

00:00:21.217 --> 00:00:23.081
(you're missing out.)

00:00:25.734 --> 00:00:27.152
[Laughing]

